  "notes": {
    "net:V+F": "The supply after the power filter: V+ (the 9 V jack) through R10 (47 Ω) smoothed by C11 (100 µF) and C12 (100 nF). It powers IC1 and the VREF divider.",
    "net:VREF": "4.5 V virtual ground from R11/R12, decoupled by C13.",
    "net:u1o": "LM308 output: gain up to ~67 dB on paper, limited by its slow slew rate and bandwidth.",
    "net:clip": "D1/D2 to ground: hard clipping at about ±0.6 V.",
    "part:C3": "The LM308's compensation cap: sets its bandwidth and slew rate, part of the Rat's sound.",
    "net:tone": "Filter control: a low-pass sweeping from about 475 Hz to 32 kHz."
  },
